    "Northrop Grumman’s fixed-price share decreased 44.4 percentage points from FY2020 to FY2026, the largest absolute change among companies with comparable endpoints.",
    "In FY2026, fixed-price accounts for 99.7% of Anduril’s $642.9M in net DoD obligations."
